# Secrets
.env
.env.local

# Recorded audio. The full set is large and contains people's voices — it stays
# local. A few sample clips are committed under clips/samples/ (force-added) so
# `npm run bench` is runnable on a fresh checkout.
clips/*
!clips/samples/
!clips/samples/**

